t":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","review_id":"COqjLJeozxVKF-dJ0EeZzw","date":"2018-02-17T14:47:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9332479238510132,"text_excerpt":"We had breakfast here yesterday morning. We were seated almost immediately and the waiter brought us water as soon as we were sat. The waiter was wonderful! He brought us a sample of the pickle vodka they use for the bloody Mary's. It was so good! We ordered beignets to eat while we looked over the menu. The beignets were small and tasty and honestly were the best we had so far. The were filled with cinnamon and sugar. For breakfast we order two breakfast po'boys and two Crab cakes eggs Benedict, three of us ordered potatoes and one had the grits. Oh my goodness was it good! I highly recommend it!"},{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","review_id":"EAvMSqViULGjuHIGgFxjkg","date":"2016-09-10T15:15:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9313939213752747,"text_excerpt":"Started with beignet fries and also had the Jackson Square (omelet full of crawfish and shrimp) and I had to try the sausage gravy with biscuits. All was great, though I prefer my sausage gravy...think it's because their biscuits were not as dense as mine...and Dustin was our server and was quick and friendly. We'd recommend this place BUT the appetizer fries are enough for 3-4 people and could be a dessert as well!"},{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","review_id":"wkUvHJxOOBPwkoJHI9dfvA","date":"2018-06-24T15:56:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9254103302955627,"text_excerpt":"We went there for breakfast as we had planned to get beignets across the street at Cafe du monde but didn't want to wait 30 minutes to then sit outside in the heat for only one option-beignets. The food at Monty's was all awesome. We got the beignet fries-better than regular beignets! We also got te Cajun boudin Benedict, which was awesome-so different and very NOLA-esque! And then my dad got a build your own omelette which was really good as well. It was a little pricey, but not crazy expensive and the food was worth it in my opinion!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","photo_id":"azrDrr_ZjplnNkimDS6TkA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/azrDrr_ZjplnNkimDS6TkA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.821392834186554},{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","photo_id":"RhL5FXaajH-OENne816_jQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/RhL5FXaajH-OENne816_jQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8145203590393066},{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","photo_id":"1z8MZ_K0vQdenY6rCo5eGw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1z8MZ_K0vQdenY6rCo5eGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8144872188568115},{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","photo_id":"gcVtJ6aFNn5fTM-CiSkOeQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gcVtJ6aFNn5fTM-CiSkOeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7561569213867188},{"business_id":"INeL2YsGJRX-QulzFRKKXg","photo_id":"ECivGStsFLhsovZc5r4eGw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ECivGStsFLhsovZc5r4eGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7324198484420776}]},"notebook_case":null}
